card werk-model-persist-chat-read  [open]
Reading a conversation returns its saved settings next to its messages
why: The pane must show the selector and the pie before any message. Giving the settings in the same read as the transcript means one request fills the whole header.

A read of a conversation builds it if it is not yet built, so a restart shows the saved model and fill. The answer holds the messages and the settings together. See #werk-model-persist.

